      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. i checked the image and curl is definitely there, so maybe it's the path issue you mentioned. i'm also seeing some weirdness with the liveness probes failing right after the postStart hook error. \n\ncould you help me narrow it down? like, how can i tell if the probe itself is failing because of the missing curl, or if there's an actual resource issue like OOMKiller or something stalling the process? i don't want to waste time resizing the nodes if it's just a path error.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
